through its length and block `k`'s `BlockOn` (a predicate of ONE block at that block's shape, L18's), and reaches the
model only through the joint gate (`RunShapeProtocol.lean`, which replaces L2's `RunSat` chain by `RunSatP`'s and L2's
`CircuitIff` by `classifyRunP_circuitIff`). So the transfer is the re-indexing, and the generated proofs are the
